With a .booping marker above the cwd the run appends exactly one [frontmatter-update] line to the attached vault's log.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plan.md --
---
title: Demo
status: backlog
---
# Demo
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update vault/plan.md status=in-progress
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- vault/plan.md
+++ vault/plan.md
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 ---
 title: Demo
-status: backlog
+status: in-progress
 ---
 # Demo
-- stderr --
updated vault/plan.md: status=in-progress
-- expected/cwd/vault/.booping.log --
[..]Z: [frontmatter-update] vault/plan.md status
-- expected/cwd/vault/plan.md --
---
title: Demo
status: in-progress
---
# Demo
